WEBVTT

00:01:59.316 --> 00:02:05.067
Pause now to figure it out for yourself.

00:02:05.927 --> 00:02:09.747
Upon inspection, 
most of these scores are concerning.

00:02:09.747 --> 00:02:11.641
Let’s start with the highest.

00:02:11.641 --> 00:02:13.992
Bertram scored 840.

00:02:13.992 --> 00:02:16.932
That’s impressive… 
but is it even possible?

00:02:16.932 --> 00:02:21.452
The highest numbers on the two dice 
are 17 and 18.

00:02:21.452 --> 00:02:25.798
17 plus 18 is 35, so in 20 rolls,

00:02:25.798 --> 00:02:31.784
the greatest possible total 
is 20 times 35, or 700.